":"이제부터","x":927,"y":2420,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"프로토콜","x":1078,"y":2424,"width":141,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":1238,"y":2422,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"단위에","x":1363,"y":2422,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":1491,"y":2423,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"“세그먼트보다는","x":1582,"y":2420,"width":281,"height":42}]},{"text":"“패킷”이라는 용어를 시용한다. 왜냐하면 이 절에서 전개된 이론은 대체로 컴퓨터 네","words":[{"text":"“패킷”이라는","x":509,"y":2481,"width":193,"height":40},{"text":"용어를","x":717,"y":2482,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"시용한다.","x":833,"y":2482,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"왜냐하면","x":995,"y":2484,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1149,"y":2484,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"절에서","x":1201,"y":2485,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"전개된","x":1325,"y":2486,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"이론은","x":1451,"y":2486,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"대체로","x":1578,"y":2486,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1711,"y":2484,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"네","x":1834,"y":2482,"width":26,"height":39}]},{"text":"트워크에 적용하는 것이고, 단지 인터넷 트랜스 포트 계층에만 적용하는 것이 아니므","words":[{"text":"트워크에","x":507,"y":2544,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"적용하는","x":658,"y":2545,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"것이고,","x":806,"y":2545,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"단지","x":931,"y":2546,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"인터넷","x":1016,"y":2546,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"트랜스","x":1131,"y":2547,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"포트","x":1252,"y":2551,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"계층에만","x":1341,"y":2548,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"적용하는","x":1504,"y":2548,"width":149,"height":39},{"text":"것이","x":1671,"y":2548,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"아니므","x":1762,"y":2546,"width":100,"height":40}]},{"text":"로, 여기에서는 일반 용어인 “패것”이 더 적절하다고 본다.","words":[{"text":"로,","x":507,"y":2609,"width":41,"height":35},{"text":"여기에서는","x":564,"y":2606,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"일반","x":744,"y":2607,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"용어인","x":820,"y":2607,"width":99,"height":39},{"te